Find Max Sum Subarray of Size K
=================================

   int[] arr = {100, 200, 300, 400} ,  K = 2


   Brute force Approach :
   ======================

   Time Complexity : (N-K) * K
                      (NK+K^2)


   int sum = 0;
   int maxSum = 0;

   for(i=0; i < N-K+1; i++) {                 ------> N-K
        sum = 0;
        for(int j=i; j < i+K; j++) {         ------>  K
            sum += arr[j];
        }
        maxSum = Math.max(maxSum, sum);
   }